[[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect pipe from quick release fitting (1a) on the the filter\nand connector (1b) on the return manifold.</p><p>2. Remove the supply pipe from the filter to the return manifold.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002283.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the delivery pipe and connect\n to the fuel filter and fuel manifold.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a></p>"]]